Text:
#NaturallyLangkawi Ep 4: Day 1 in Langkawi: Where to Go & What to Do?

Day 1 in Langkawi nak buat apa dulu? Breakfast mana best? Nak chill dulu ke terus gerak aktiviti? Atau nak cari sikit adrenaline?

Jom ikut flow santai kami. Start dengan breakfast kampung dekat airport, lepas tu cycling slow-slow di Ulu Melaka, coffee stop yang aesthetic, and end sikit dengan jetski laju di Pantai Cenang.

One day, banyak vibe.. relax, fun, and sedikit adventure. Memang island mood on point.

